### name: recovery.scope.sort
--- note
Aggregate bindings end when evaluation exits, including a missing-value error recovered by ?? (§6.1).
--- source
(SORT((1,2), X, MISSING) ?? 0); X
--- expect
error E_UNDEF_VAR
===

### name: recovery.scope.sort-shadow
--- note
After recovery, the original context binding is visible again.
--- source
X = 99; (SORT((1,2), X, MISSING) ??? 0); X
--- expect
num 99
===

### name: recovery.scope.top
--- note
Aggregate bindings end when evaluation exits, including a missing-value error recovered by ?? (§6.1).
--- source
(TOP((1,2), X, MISSING, 1) ?? 0); X
--- expect
error E_UNDEF_VAR
===

### name: recovery.scope.top-shadow
--- note
After recovery, the original context binding is visible again.
--- source
X = 99; (TOP((1,2), X, MISSING, 1) ??? 0); X
--- expect
num 99
===

### name: recovery.scope.bucket
--- note
Aggregate bindings end when evaluation exits, including a missing-value error recovered by ?? (§6.1).
--- source
(BUCKET((1,2), MISSING) ?? 0); _
--- expect
error E_UNDEF_VAR
===

### name: recovery.scope.bucket-shadow
--- note
After recovery, the original context binding is visible again.
--- source
_ = 99; (BUCKET((1,2), MISSING) ??? 0); _
--- expect
num 99
===

### name: recovery.scope.assignment
--- note
A recovered aggregate must not leave a binder that forbids a later assignment.
--- source
(SORT((1,2), X, MISSING) ?? 0); X = 7; X
--- expect
num 7
===

